Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.30,0:00:05.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with you and\NI don't care who knows it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.50,0:00:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dreams do come true, my friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.40,0:00:09.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been reincarnated in\Nthe world of my favorite
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.80,0:00:12.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,dating sim where I'm in\Nlove with the villainess,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.22,0:00:13.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire Francois.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.92,0:00:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How could anyone not fall for that wicked
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.10,0:00:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,gaggle she does when\Nshe's being malicious?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:21.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's my perfect evil queen\Nand I would die for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.34,0:00:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see which of us performs\Nbetter on tomorrow's exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.56,0:00:30.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If my scores are higher, then you're to\Nremove yourself from this academy at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.18,0:00:33.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And finally, we have the results\Nof the Magic Ability Exam.
