Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.70,0:00:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First place, Ray Taylor. Unmeasurable?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.66,0:00:51.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does unmeasurable even mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.88,0:00:53.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And she's still placed first?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.30,0:00:54.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It wasn't even close then?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.88,0:00:55.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.02,0:00:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough chatter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.40,0:00:58.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.31,0:01:01.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because we've not yet determined how\Nto categorize Ray Taylor's scores,
Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.33,0:01:06.04,Signs_Boxed,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\pos(0,0)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HF7F7F7&}m 389.875 71.625 l 1469.625 71.25 1469.375 997.375 390.625 998.625
