Dialogue: 1,0:00:58.33,0:01:06.04,Signs_Boxed,,0,0,0,,{\an4\fnCalibri\b0\bord6\c&H000000&\3c&HF7F7F7&\fs75\fsp4.2\pos(870,936)\blur1}Thane  Bauer
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.48,0:01:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and because she is a new student,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.32,0:01:06.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she has been excluded\Nfrom the overall results.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.10,0:01:07.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is all. Dismissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.96,0:01:09.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, how did you...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:12.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I demand an explanation for this at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.22,0:01:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unmeasurable magic ability!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.92,0:01:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have never heard of such a thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.40,0:01:23.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ray, did you intentionally miss the\Ntarget during the magic tool exam?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.56,0:01:32.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, miss it on purpose?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.34,0:01:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why would she do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.24,0:01:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.24,0:01:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why I asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.72,0:01:39.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You missed it, and you\Nstill came in first?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.56,0:01:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means her score in the Magic\NAbility Exam must have been quite high.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.72,0:01:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Higher than what is accurately measurable.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, it stands to reason\Nher marks were above exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.04,0:01:51.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.95,0:01:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that would have caused the\Nscoring device to malfunction,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.36,0:01:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which leaves us with just\None possible explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.68,0:02:00.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth and water, fire, wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:04.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are four elemental attributes, and\Nnormally a person can possess only one.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.42,0:02:07.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what if Rey here\Nactually has two of them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.40,0:02:09.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.64,0:02:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A commoner like her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.08,0:02:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, she could never have\Nbeen granted such a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.74,0:02:16.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's merely my own\Nspeculation, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.80,0:02:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you are right, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.62,0:02:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rey's a dual caster.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.78,0:02:21.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ding, ding, ding!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.88,0:02:22.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a winner!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.96,0:02:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The protagonist of Revolution\Ncan use two attributes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.96,0:02:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.36,0:02:28.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As Misha deduced,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.52,0:02:32.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's a dual caster, an incredibly rare\Nclassification in the world of the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.70,0:02:35.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's more, she's ranked\Nexceptional in both elements.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.06,0:02:37.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The highest score you can get.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.50,0:02:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That triggers the unmeasurable result,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.88,0:02:42.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which we just saw play out\Nin the first exam event.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.50,0:02:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So yeah, long story short, it\Nwas totally rigged in my favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.28,0:02:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did great.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.54,0:02:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Placing third behind two of the\Nprincesses is an amazing achievement.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.66,0:02:54.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, she's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.57,0:02:57.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really needn't trouble\Nyourself over some commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.20,0:02:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:01.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll put her out of my mind at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.62,0:03:03.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hello, Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.96,0:03:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My goodness, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look like you saw a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.20,0:03:08.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, do I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.11,0:03:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, perhaps you shouldn't\Nappear as if from nowhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:12.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want, commoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:15.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were excluded from the exam\Nresults, so our competition is canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:18.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we were only betting\Nthat you would win.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.24,0:03:20.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you didn't, I get a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.78,0:03:21.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.88,0:03:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I made sure to choose my\Nwords extremely carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.62,0:03:28.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you don't win, that means I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.50,0:03:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you'll have to do one\Nthing that I ask of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.84,0:03:34.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My score wasn't counted,\Nso yours can't be higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.54,0:03:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means I automatically\Nwin the bet because
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.76,0:03:39.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we never said that I had\Nto do better than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.20,0:03:41.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You brazen little cheater!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.98,0:03:43.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sorry to trick you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:46.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you blatantly deceive me,\Nthe results are nullified!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.02,0:03:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no obligation to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.64,0:03:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.55,0:03:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're gonna go back on your word?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.86,0:03:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After we swore in front of God?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.06,0:03:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this kingdom, swearing to God\Nis an act of extreme significance.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.84,0:04:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who breaks that vow is held in\Ncontempt regardless of social status.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.10,0:04:04.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it that you demand?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.50,0:04:07.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you are gonna do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.24,0:04:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure is good to love an honest woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.82,0:04:11.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and tell me what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.46,0:04:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My request is a simple one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.58,0:04:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Promise me you won't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.74,0:04:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.16,0:04:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how bad things\Nget, you can't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to fight through\Nwhatever comes till the very end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.28,0:04:27.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I'm confused.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.14,0:04:29.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's all you want of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A promise that I won't give up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:33.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.75,0:04:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say it and I'll consider your debt paid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.86,0:04:40.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must admit I thought you\Nwould ask for something dodgier.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.76,0:04:42.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totes can if that's what you prefer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.88,0:04:45.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want to fulfill some\Nhot fantasies I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.32,0:04:46.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's quite all right!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.70,0:04:49.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, fair is fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.32,0:04:55.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear before God that I,\NClaire, will never give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.28,0:04:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens,\NI will not abandon hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.32,0:05:01.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I promise to continue\Nfighting until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.94,0:05:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have I fulfilled our\Nverbal agreements then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.08,0:05:08.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.12,0:05:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.76,0:05:13.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't lose again
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.30,0:05:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Miss Claire!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.40,0:05:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you want now? I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.18,0:05:24.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I honestly despise you, Retailer!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:25.55,0:05:28.84,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Must you tell me every thought that crosses your mind?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:29.14,0:05:31.81,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I've gotta tell you how I feel!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:31.97,0:05:34.77,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Are you so unaware of how different our worlds are?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:35.06,0:05:37.95,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Then let's bring up a revolution!
Dialogue: 1,0:05:37.95,0:05:40.91,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Do you know? Who I am
Dialogue: 1,0:05:40.91,0:05:43.94,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Yes, I know! That sky-high pride of yours
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.66,0:05:46.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, two, one, say not to you?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:43.94,0:05:46.96,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}What you want? Tell me now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.56,0:05:49.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I want, only you.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:46.96,0:05:49.28,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}All I want! Only you!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.28,0:05:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't know if you're in love with me?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:49.28,0:05:53.17,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how immersive this game may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:55.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in love with me, right?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:53.17,0:05:55.66,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Aren't you way too into it?
Dialogue: 1,0:05:55.66,0:05:57.29,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}If I do it differently,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.96,0:05:57.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want you to say not to me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:57.29,0:05:59.13,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}there won't be a happy ending
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.56,0:05:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Happy End.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.68,0:06:01.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in love with me.
Dialogue: 1,0:05:59.13,0:06:01.54,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}What nonsense are you babbling about?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.72,0:06:04.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in love with me.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:01.73,0:06:05.05,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}My wildest fantasies became my reality…
Dialogue: 1,0:06:05.05,0:06:07.55,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Ah, cool! You're cool! Beautiful!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.10,0:06:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call you who, I call you who.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, you're in love with me.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:07.74,0:06:10.80,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Bringing such disruption to my once peaceful days…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.04,0:06:13.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call you who, I call you who.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:11.14,0:06:13.56,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I can't believe! You have to leave!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.50,0:06:18.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't like it, I don't\Nthink it's going to start.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:13.77,0:06:15.43,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Love and hate both,
Dialogue: 1,0:06:15.43,0:06:21.67,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Without a partner, those feelings can never start!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.16,0:06:25.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So raise your hand! I'm right now.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:22.31,0:06:24.28,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}So raise your hands!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:24.28,0:06:28.07,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}It's time to give in to happiness!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The love of happiness is just one thing.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:28.07,0:06:33.03,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}There's only one right choice here:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.00,0:06:34.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the heart of the heart.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:33.03,0:06:34.91,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}from the bottom of your heart, hold up and
Dialogue: 1,0:06:34.91,0:06:37.66,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}Raise your hands! Surrender already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.00,0:06:42.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Raise your hand!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:37.66,0:06:40.96,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! Throw 'em up and celebrate!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:40.96,0:06:43.75,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! One more time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once again, let your\Nhands be a good world.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:43.75,0:06:46.38,op_eng,Claire & Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}Raise your hands! For this fantastic world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.38,0:06:48.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to give up until I miss you!
Dialogue: 1,0:06:46.38,0:06:50.26,op_eng,Claire,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,0)}I won't give up until you tell me what you're planning!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.96,0:06:52.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's interesting. I love you.
Dialogue: 1,0:06:50.26,0:06:53.10,op_eng,Rae,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}You're so awesome! I love you!
