Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.02,0:07:16.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's been quite the process, but\NI made it to the final interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.20,0:07:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kapow!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.62,0:07:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in the scholarship program at the\NAcademy, so I don't have to pay tuition.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.26,0:07:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'd like another source\Nof income for basic living.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.70,0:07:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, if I have a job as your maid,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.12,0:07:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get to make some extra cash while\Nspending quality time with you,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.92,0:07:30.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which is a total win-win sitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.84,0:07:32.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Win-win sitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be a win-win if\Nthere are no mutual benefits!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.34,0:07:36.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Reject it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:37.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shred that application!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.20,0:07:40.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're absolutely certain\Nthat's what you want, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.46,0:07:44.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, I found her to be\Nsuperior to every other candidate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.42,0:07:46.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her skills are exceptional.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.08,0:07:48.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She also appears to have\Na deep sense of loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.40,0:07:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to disagree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.62,0:07:52.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loyalty's for the puppies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.30,0:07:54.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies, what you see is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.16,0:07:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True love!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.00,0:07:59.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,True love.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.46,0:08:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply cannot have a maid working\Nfor me who says things like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.90,0:08:04.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard shouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.52,0:08:05.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Claire's father, Dole, a duke\Nand the kingdom's minister of finance.
