Dialogue: 1,0:08:09.18,0:08:14.72,Signs_Boxed,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\pos(0,0)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&}m 620.625 843.375 l 1306.25 844.5 1308.625 946.25 620.625 945.125
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.66,0:08:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's also third in the line of succession\Nbehind the king and prime minister.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.16,0:08:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I apologize for the disturbance, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.82,0:08:23.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We were selecting a maid to\Nattend school with Miss Claire,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.56,0:08:26.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and it would appear she is not happy\Nwith my top choice for the position.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:29.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Her personality renders\Nher completely unsuitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.82,0:08:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's always attempting\Nto make a fool of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.24,0:08:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.15,0:08:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If our headmaid has chosen her, I'm\Nsure she is more than qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.78,0:08:43.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, if Claire disapproves of this\Ndecision, then we will not hire her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.32,0:08:44.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.02,0:08:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am confident there are many\Nothers suited to be your maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.58,0:08:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Your Grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.84,0:08:54.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope you will pardon my insolence, but\NI would like to have a word with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.56,0:08:57.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you a commoner requesting\Nto speak to a noble?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.60,0:09:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It appears my Claire's judgment\Nof your character was correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.82,0:09:02.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Such impudence will not be.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.56,0:09:03.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Irvine Manuel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:10.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just who might that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.62,0:09:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,March the 3rd.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Five hundred thousand gold.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.88,0:09:18.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father, what does that mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.66,0:09:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you two mind giving me a\Nmoment to converse with the girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.20,0:09:23.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might I assign a guard first?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.70,0:09:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider it an order.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.48,0:09:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must we both leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely at least I can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.02,0:09:30.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am sorry, Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.04,0:09:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bear with me for now. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.94,0:09:37.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I simply need to confirm a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.64,0:09:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.36,0:09:46.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, why don't you\Ntell me who you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.14,0:09:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what exactly you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.86,0:10:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.74,0:10:03.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.88,0:10:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You will accept this girl as your maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.74,0:10:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did she say to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.16,0:10:12.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You were against the\Nidea only a moment ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.06,0:10:17.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All you need to know is that she is\Ntrustworthy and qualified to be your maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.16,0:10:17.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.12,0:10:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me what you said\Nto my father right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.42,0:10:21.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing you don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.68,0:10:24.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just told him I love\Nyou and always will.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.84,0:10:26.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.75,0:10:27.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is completely absurd!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.22,0:10:30.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please think of what this request entails.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.12,0:10:32.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear the way she speaks to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.18,0:10:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How can I trust her when I'm a - Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.68,0:10:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's easy to find someone\Nobedient to serve at your side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.16,0:10:43.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I want the only child of Francois to\Nprove she knows how to rein in a servant.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.34,0:10:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you truly insisting I\Nhire this crass commoner?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.56,0:10:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very well, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.60,0:11:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You As my maid you are to obey me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.86,0:11:03.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Under no circumstances\Nwill I tolerate slacking.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.16,0:11:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.46,0:11:05.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.76,0:11:07.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you shall start tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.76,0:11:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.76,0:11:11.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's in the best hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:13.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll spend my whole life servicing her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.18,0:11:16.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Again I do not care for your phrasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.24,0:11:19.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.70,0:11:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.74,0:11:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did I do to deserve this?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:38.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't endure this a moment more!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.42,0:11:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You lech!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.34,0:11:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You believe your eyes\Nwon't expose your thoughts?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.46,0:11:44.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My apologies, miss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.86,0:11:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just need a few more minutes\Nof staring at that I'll be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.04,0:11:48.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.06,0:11:49.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Turn around at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.02,0:11:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.93,0:11:51.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:52.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly are you staring at?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.48,0:11:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, Ray, deep breaths.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.66,0:11:58.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It isn't very nice to tease\NMiss Claire like that, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:11:59.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.56,0:12:00.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:03.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She just looked so radiant\NI couldn't help myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.54,0:12:05.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's enough of your revolting flattery!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.70,0:12:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.20,0:12:10.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing good will ever come of\Nentrusting anything to this commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.54,0:12:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have Lene assist me\Nwith changing as always.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.98,0:12:14.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, Miss Claire, give her a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:17.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you don't allow Ray to gain\Nany experience, she won't learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.76,0:12:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that could really\Nlead to trouble later
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.48,0:12:21.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if I get sick and can't take care of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.46,0:12:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I suppose you have a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.06,0:12:26.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, this is Lene Aurousseau.
