Dialogue: 1,0:12:26.10,0:12:31.77,Signs_Boxed,Text,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\pos(0,0)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\c&HFFFFFF&}m 578.25 885.75 l 1358.875 885.75 1360 988 578.625 986.625
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's a senior maid who's been on Miss\NClaire's staff since they were children.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.54,0:12:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's actually from one of the wealthiest\Nmerchant companies in the kingdom,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.08,0:12:36.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Oruso Company.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:40.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even though she's a commoner, she's pretty\Nwell off and isn't hurting for money.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.68,0:12:41.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.68,0:12:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Oruso Company only sent\Nher to serve the Minister of
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.82,0:12:47.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finance in order to establish\Na business connection with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.92,0:12:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But more on that later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.26,0:12:50.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.86,0:12:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you certain, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:53.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.11,0:12:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've left your peppers again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.88,0:12:56.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's uncouth to be so wasteful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:13:01.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sometimes she seems more like\Nan older sister than a maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.44,0:13:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does it matter, Lene?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.00,0:13:05.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I eat plenty of other vegetables.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.04,0:13:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.36,0:13:10.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But this is the only crop that was\Npaid for with the common folk's taxes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.72,0:13:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a sign of gratitude\Nif a noble eats them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.00,0:13:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.91,0:13:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're them to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be honored to eat them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.44,0:13:19.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like kissing you in direct!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.18,0:13:22.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, I ate them!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.96,0:13:24.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It worked. Nice job.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.82,0:13:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just happy to be of assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.44,0:13:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I've no doubt my nutritional\Nintake is your utmost concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.10,0:13:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, who can tell us about the\Neffects of Cooley III's policies?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.34,0:13:35.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you, Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.62,0:13:37.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.04,0:13:45.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a maid, Lene doesn't come\Nto lectures with Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.72,0:13:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.63,0:13:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,since I'm also a student, I get to serve\Nin her place whenever we're at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.76,0:13:53.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And thus, our kingdom\Nbecame self-sufficient.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.28,0:13:56.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We no longer needed to\Nrely on imports for food.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.74,0:13:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Very good answer. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.72,0:14:07.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey there, Ray. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.50,0:14:10.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi, Prince Rod.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.86,0:14:11.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got some time?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.06,0:14:13.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we play a game together?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh gosh, I wish I could, but\NI've got maid stuff to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.04,0:14:18.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.95,0:14:21.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll just have to ask again later.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.14,0:14:22.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here whenever you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.62,0:14:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, but I really need\Nto take care of Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.56,0:14:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bring Claire along with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.02,0:14:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can all have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.30,0:14:31.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I totally get I'm in a dating sim,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.52,0:14:36.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the amount of flirt bombs going off\Nat all times still makes me super anxious.
Dialogue: 2,0:14:35.48,0:14:42.24,Signs,Text,0,0,0,,{\fnHiroshige\fs60\blur0.9\c&H000000&\pos(625,145)}The Princes' Affection Levels
