Dialogue: 1,0:14:35.48,0:14:42.24,Signs_Boxed,,0,0,0,,{\an7\bord0\shad0\blur1\pos(0,0)\fscx100\fscy100\p1\clip(m 260 115 l 260 235 990 235 990 115)}m 265 120 l 985 120 985 230 265 230
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.14,0:14:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone who wants to follow\NPrince Rod's route has to
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.88,0:14:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,get excellent scores on\Npretty much all of the exams.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.26,0:14:44.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least that's what I thought,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.10,0:14:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but apparently just throwing the\Nmagic tool exam wasn't enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.38,0:14:48.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hope it doesn't get awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.02,0:14:51.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Thane, you want to join in?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.00,0:14:54.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually I select Prince\NThane's route because
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.30,0:14:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's the one where Miss Claire\Nshows up the most. Leave me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.68,0:15:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.94,0:15:04.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was the sound of Prince Thane's\Naffection for me crashing to the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.96,0:15:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, Ray, why are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.56,0:15:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because I don't want you to\Nfollow me, but here you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.82,0:15:17.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hi Rae! First catch your breath, then tell\Nme how class went—no trouble to report.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but i really can't say\Ni did any actual work
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.02,0:15:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,though that's because\Nmiss claire's always been
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.58,0:15:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,an excellent student it\Nsounds like i won't be
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,doing a lot as her tutor\Nthen will i oh don't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.82,0:15:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you worry i promise we'll\Nkeep you much busier
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.32,0:15:33.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the afternoons now\Nlet's get out there and do
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.96,0:15:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything we can to keep\Nour mistress happy. Oh
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.72,0:15:40.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,miss claire i've been\Nmeaning to ask if you've
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.86,0:15:43.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heard about the latest\Nconfection by brumet more
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.38,0:15:46.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,than heard of it i've\Nhad a taste in fact they
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.34,0:15:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,call it chocolate and it's heavenly really
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.64,0:15:51.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're so lucky brumet is\Nthe most popular eatery
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.72,0:15:53.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the capital that you've\Nalready sampled their
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.06,0:15:57.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,much awaited new item\Ni have it's very sweet
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.36,0:15:59.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and creamy with a hint\Nof bitterness it has a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.88,0:16:02.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rich aroma and tastes\Nunlike any other sweet i've
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.10,0:16:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Never know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.01,0:16:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you're interested in trying it, I\Ncan have some sent to your room later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.18,0:16:08.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.09,0:16:10.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd do that for me? Hey!\NNo fair! I want some too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.68,0:16:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commoner, run along and prepare\Nsome chocolate for Pepi and Loretta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.30,0:16:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My pleasure, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.18,0:16:23.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire, are you sure it's okay\Nto keep someone like her by your side?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.58,0:16:25.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Alas, I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.12,0:16:28.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I didn't want her anywhere near me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.30,0:16:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But father felt it was important for\Nme to practice taming the servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.38,0:16:34.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which means I won't be allowed\Neven a moment to myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.88,0:16:37.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That must be so terrible for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.38,0:16:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the one I'm\Ncomplaining about, Simpleton.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:41.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so lucky to serve, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.44,0:16:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Though I don't imagine\Nyou've tried the chocolate.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.84,0:16:47.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless she gives you treats\Nwhen you've been a good girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.64,0:16:50.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Treats, don't be absurd.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.36,0:16:53.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need to show\Ncompassion to a maid like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.38,0:16:54.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's completely true.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.74,0:16:56.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need her to give me sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.42,0:17:00.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just one freshly worn blouse of hers\Ncan carry me for three whole meals.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.38,0:17:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:04.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sort of thing is exactly\Nwhat makes her so repellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.98,0:17:08.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You certainly do like Miss Claire\Na great deal, don't you? Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.08,0:17:10.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.50,0:17:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.41,0:17:14.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was that sadness I just saw crawl\Nacross your face, Miss Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.20,0:17:17.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It would bother you if I\Nstopped loving you, wouldn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.18,0:17:18.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bother me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.09,0:17:19.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's your affection that bothers me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.86,0:17:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You haven't stopped clinging to\NMiss Claire since you arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a blast. I was about to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.60,0:17:25.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't like Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.76,0:17:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.88,0:17:30.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be known, I'm\Nmadly in love with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.08,0:17:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now this is real luxury.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.96,0:17:38.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it is far more\Nthan a commoner deserves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:41.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, the water of this spring\Nis drawn from the Thassel Volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.88,0:17:43.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And is set to make your skin glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.02,0:17:46.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow, God bless that volcano.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Miss Claire, let's go, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.54,0:17:52.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'd better hurry and finish\Nup before you catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.44,0:17:56.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'll go ahead and\Ngive her skin a good scrubbing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.38,0:17:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you could manage\Nwashing her hair for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.04,0:17:59.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.95,0:18:02.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you try anything\Nfunny, I will destroy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.32,0:18:09.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're quite good at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.60,0:18:10.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.58,0:18:15.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hair is so beautiful\Nand so easy to wash.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.22,0:18:18.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love the feel of naturally\Nstraight hair, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.88,0:18:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of Lene's tasks is to do\NMiss Claire's hair every morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.24,0:18:24.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's the artist behind\Nthose gorgeous curls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.22,0:18:28.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The style was actually inspired\Nby Miss Claire's mother's hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.78,0:18:30.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I'm going to rinse it off now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.32,0:18:50.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Absolutely not with the nosebleeds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:51.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I smeared my lipstick!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.64,0:18:53.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This has been wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.28,0:18:55.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are quite talented, Ray.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.54,0:18:57.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I consider it a privilege\Nto get to work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.98,0:18:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.74,0:19:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I would suggest holding\Noff on celebrating her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.06,0:19:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something tells me this commoner\Nwon't be around for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.36,0:19:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, stop being so hard on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.30,0:19:09.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least use her name instead of commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.56,0:19:11.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A commoner is a commoner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:17.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps if you stop telling\Neveryone you're in love with me,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.32,0:19:20.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might refer to you by name\Ninstead of sad generic nouns.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.48,0:19:21.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No thanks!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.39,0:19:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't answer right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.66,0:19:26.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really are a strange girl, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.16,0:19:29.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you've only\Nrecently met Miss Claire,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.38,0:19:32.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,yet it seems as though you know\Nnearly everything about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.74,0:19:34.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chalk it up to the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.70,0:19:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.18,0:19:45.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be heading back to\Nthe servants' quarters now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:46.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.77,0:19:47.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, sweet dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.58,0:19:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You alright, Ms.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.68,0:19:58.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Claire?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.59,0:19:59.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did the heat make you dizzy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.30,0:20:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A little.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.54,0:20:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seemed like you were sort of in\Na daze when we were in the bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.14,0:20:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if my fingers are magic?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.00,0:20:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have I possessed your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.60,0:20:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silence, you!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.50,0:20:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be going back\Nto your room about now?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.40,0:20:17.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will, once you're able to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.90,0:20:20.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Want a goodnight kiss to help you relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.90,0:20:23.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maids are not permitted to do\Nthat under any circumstances!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.96,0:20:25.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, I just wanted to say it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.86,0:20:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Honestly, commoner, grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.68,0:20:34.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.64,0:20:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.44,0:20:39.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.78,0:20:42.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then explain something to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.82,0:20:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep telling me you love me?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.48,0:20:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just think you're so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.24,0:20:49.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't help myself sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.00,0:20:52.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you're fixated on my appearance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.54,0:20:54.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I love your personality too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.08,0:21:01.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am well aware of what\Nkind of personality I have.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.58,0:21:06.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I know that it is\Nnot the lovable kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.96,0:21:08.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not true at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.20,0:21:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spare me your hollow flattery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.08,0:21:11.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.86,0:21:13.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What exactly is it you want from me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.10,0:21:22.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.94,0:21:24.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm in love with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.80,0:21:28.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here because I want to\Nbe by your side. That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see you're not ready\Nto let go of that facade.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.94,0:21:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think I'm\Nmaking all this up? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.50,0:21:43.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well then, it sounds like I'll have\Nto work harder to prove it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.36,0:21:55.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go to bed, you're impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.42,0:22:03.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good night, Miss Claire.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.76,0:22:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.12,0:22:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have it your way.
