Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.18,0:23:09.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,next time.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:10.66,0:23:12.89,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(0,240)}No matter how much I bully you,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.89,0:23:14.23,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}It doesn't bother you at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.00,0:23:16.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want that to be a part of the new world!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.23,0:23:15.10,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}How infuriating!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.08,0:23:16.77,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Dear God, I can't take it anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do it!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:16.77,0:23:17.94,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I'll make sure you understand my words:
Dialogue: 1,0:23:17.94,0:23:20.73,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}It's your time to apologize, soul-search, and feel remorse...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.38,0:23:19.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.29,0:23:21.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to do it.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:20.73,0:23:22.07,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Bow down to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.96,0:23:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.07,0:23:22.86,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}You see,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:22.86,0:23:24.57,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}Even if it's for a minute or just a second,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.26,0:23:28.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, you're not going to die.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:24.57,0:23:25.53,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,0)}I won't let you get away with this!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:26.80,0:23:27.74,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I mean, oh!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.74,0:23:31.70,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}She is my wonder girl of world!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.88,0:23:35.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the end of the world!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:31.70,0:23:35.66,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}There has been no one like you in my world
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.42,0:23:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna teach you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:35.66,0:23:39.63,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}So I'll make sure you know this:
Dialogue: 1,0:23:39.63,0:23:41.38,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}No matter when or where,
Dialogue: 1,0:23:41.38,0:23:44.55,ed_eng_02_pink,,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fade(240,240)}I'll be here to face off against you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.78,0:23:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss Claire, do you like games?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.14,0:23:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who do you think I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.58,0:23:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As the only Francois daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.18,0:23:56.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know every form of amusement\Nnecessary in high society.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.08,0:23:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.99,0:23:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then would you like to play\Nthe Prince game with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.18,0:24:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.09,0:24:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world is that?
